  unitName: Harpy
  unitId: 40050
  unitNumber: 73
  description: A half-human, half-bird female monster from the birdman tribe. With
    her lusty nature, she seduces young men on sight. Men who take her invitation,
    tempted by her lascivious looks, are taken to the harpy nest, and fed to harpy
    children. However, there is no safe choice. Someone who refuses is immediately
    charged and ripped to shreds by her sharp claws.
  summonDesc: I've been charmed by you.<br>I will protect you from now on.
  fusionDesc: You're nice.<br>You think I am too, right?
